{"unit_id":"zhangx413__dsh-pbr-material#card-zh","repo":"zhangx413/dsh-pbr-material","commit":"195babe4dc085d4552754f8e67e164c4b63c6411","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-pbr-material**（DSH 网页端插件）：把物体或表面照片转成可平铺的 PBR 材质贴图集。它在 DSH 注册 agent 工具、中文工作台和 ComfyUI 接口；可直接保留平面贴图细节，也可先用 FLUX.2 Klein 重绘倾斜物体照片，再推导 albedo、normal、height、roughness、AO、curvature 和 metallic，并测量平铺效果。适合制作游戏与 3D 素材的用户。需要本机 ComfyUI、Python 图像库和约 12.5 GB 模型权重；无需额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:94-139","lib/tools.js:142-167","lib/graphs.js:92-172","lib/models.js:21-53"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangx413__dsh-pbr-material#card-en","repo":"zhangx413/dsh-pbr-material","commit":"195babe4dc085d4552754f8e67e164c4b63c6411","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pbr-material is a DSH plugin that creates tileable PBR maps from photos. It preserves flat textures or reconstructs angled photos, then derives seven maps and checks tiling. It needs local ComfyUI, Python image libraries, and 12.5 GB of model weights.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:94-139","lib/tools.js:142-167","lib/graphs.js:92-172","lib/models.js:21-53"]}
